*				patching of FontBase
* 7-Feb-90	SHL		Removed Apple emulation compatibility
* 18 Apr 89	SHL		Fixed a bug in Omi's bug-fix to MATHC usage
* 31-Mar-89	Greg Omi	Fixed hardware bug with MATHC for signed math
